### ==========================================
### 登录 Auth
### ==========================================

### 登录 - 获取 token
POST http://localhost:3205/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 登出
POST http://localhost:3205/api/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "your_token_here"
}

### 刷新 token
POST http://localhost:3205/api/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "your_token_here"
}
